  "title": "Forward-Deployed Engineers Are The Training Wheels For AI Reinvention",
  "summary": "Deloitte named a forward-deployed engineering (FDE) practice back in December 2025. At the time, it read as a consulting rebrand with better vocabulary. Then, between May 4 and July 15 of this year, four technology providers committed roughly $9 billion to putting their own engineers inside their customers’ buildings. Anthropic opened with a $1.5 billion enterprise services venture alongside Blackstone, […]",
